      voice: 'gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy #ctx:is9mco'
    '|b||The researchers point to local custom: accepting a big gift puts you in debt to the giver. Refusing it refuses the obligation.':
