      voice: 'gemini:Kore | sharp, friendly co-host: asks what a smart listener would, pushes back with real objections, sometimes explains; dry wit, never exaggerated; brisk lively pace, never slow #ctx:1ma9d0h'
    '|a||So the game never measured one fairness instinct. People played it by the rules of their own everyday life.':
      mp3: 
