      voice: 'gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy #ctx:1z10ypc'
    '|a||People carry their home rules into a game. Economists call that baggage culture, but they had to pin the word down first.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 8280
      voice: gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy
    '|b||Luigi Guiso, Paola Sapienza and Luigi Zingales did, in 2006: beliefs and values that groups hand down, fairly unchanged, from generation to generation.':
      mp3: 
