      voice: 'gemini:Kore | sharp, friendly co-host: asks what a smart listener would, pushes back with real objections, sometimes explains; dry wit, never exaggerated; brisk lively pace, never slow #ctx:ysuzn1'
    '|a||A norm, like a tip, is one such rule; culture is the whole kit. To test it, find people with different heritage under the same rules.':
