      voice: 'gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy #ctx:11c3lpb'
    '|b||New York supplied them by accident. Diplomats at the United Nations had immunity: they could park illegally and never pay.':
