      voice: 'gemini:Kore | sharp, friendly co-host: asks what a smart listener would, pushes back with real objections, sometimes explains; dry wit, never exaggerated; brisk lively pace, never slow #ctx:1xouyck'
    '|a||Same city, same streets, same zero penalty. Ray Fisman and Edward Miguel counted the unpaid tickets.':
