      voice: 'gemini:Kore | sharp, friendly co-host: asks what a smart listener would, pushes back with real objections, sometimes explains; dry wit, never exaggerated; brisk lively pace, never slow #ctx:176gac3'
    '|a||And the ranking tracked how corrupt the home country is rated. A norm from home, kept where nobody enforced it.':
